Shade
=====

Shade is a Charon distribution of an ARM/iOS userland emulator. It is based on
iLEmu with Charon's patches applied as a proper source tree (not patches applied
at build time). It descends from upstream iLEmu and preserves its git history.

Provenance
----------

  Shade  = iLEmu @ 411248cdd309b3018c41dbcc2eb59cdaea2aa8e3
           + Charon's ilemu.patch          (applied at the tree root)
           + dynarmic @ 21944ab87740a957c39ddd73cd4ecaeb700f7e73
             + Charon's dynarmic.patch      (arm64 backend, in external/dynarmic)

Charon's patches are the ones carried in the Charon package recipe
(packages/i/ilemu). Shade reproduces exactly the source Charon builds; only the
form differs (a committed fork tree instead of build-time patches).

